# Named arg with @[default: ...] annotation syntax
# Positional arg x, named arg using @[default: N] annotation
# Note: the original test used [fn [x ...rest default: 10] ...] which is rejected by
# the parser ("parameter after variadic parameter"). This test uses @[default:] syntax
# instead. A proper variadic+named integration test is tracked in TODO.md.
[f: [fn [let x default@[default: 10]] [+ x default]]
 result: [f 5 default: 100]]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(x, default), "result": Int(105)})
